This crate (`symphonia-codec-truespeech`) is a pure-Rust DSP Group TrueSpeech decoder. It is
licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0, like the rest of Project Symphonia.

TrueSpeech has no public specification. The bitstream layout (including the 32-bit byte swap of
each 32-byte block), the codebooks and the other tables (`src/tables.rs`, copied from
`libavcodec/truespeech_data.h`), the filter correlation/merging, the two-point filter, the pulse
placement and the synthesis filters follow FFmpeg's `libavcodec/truespeech.c`, which is distributed
under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later.

